{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_zoe": {
        "skill": "【扩展包】掷出一颗飞星，打中第一个敌人造成<#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>魔法伤害；按真实飞行距离越远越高，最远<#ffb900ff>250%<>。",
        "skill2": "【扩展包】踢出气泡，打中敌方英雄造成<#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<>魔法伤害，<#ef5350ff>困倦<>（减速30%）<#ffb900ff>1.4秒<>后<#ef5350ff>昏睡<><#ffb900ff>2.25秒<>；受到任何伤害就醒，那一下多受一次真实伤害（有封顶）。",
        "ult": "【扩展包】跳进传送门闪向敌方英雄，掷出飞星造成<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<>魔法伤害，再射3颗飞弹。<#ff9028ff>窃法巧手<>：敌方英雄放大招时掉下法术碎片，她捡起来就射3颗飞弹，每颗<#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>，并加速40%。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_zoe": {
        "skill": "【擴充包】擲出一顆飛星，打中第一個敵人造成<#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>魔法傷害；按真實飛行距離越遠越高，最遠<#ffb900ff>250%<>。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】踢出泡泡，打中敵方英雄造成<#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<>魔法傷害，<#ef5350ff>睏倦<>（緩速30%）<#ffb900ff>1.4秒<>後<#ef5350ff>沉睡<><#ffb900ff>2.25秒<>；受到任何傷害就醒，那一下多受一次真實傷害（有上限）。",
        "ult": "【擴充包】跳進傳送門閃向敵方英雄，擲出飛星造成<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<>魔法傷害，再射3顆飛彈。<#ff9028ff>法術竊盜<>：敵方英雄放大招時掉下法術碎片，她撿起來就射3顆飛彈，每顆<#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>，並加速40%。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_zoe": {
        "skill": "[Add-on] Throws a star at the first enemy hit for <#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, more the farther it really flew, up to <#ffb900ff>250%<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Kicks a bubble: the enemy champion hit takes <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, turns <#ef5350ff>drowsy<> (slowed 30%) for <#ffb900ff>1.4s<>, then falls <#ef5350ff>asleep<> for <#ffb900ff>2.25s<>. Any damage wakes him, and that hit lands again as true damage (capped).",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Jumps through a portal toward an enemy champion, throws a star for <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and 3 missiles. <#ff9028ff>Spell Thief<>: an enemy champion's ult drops a spell shard; picking it up she throws 3 missiles, <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> each, and gains 40% move speed."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_zoe": {
        "skill": "[확장] 별을 던져 처음 맞힌 적에게 <#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> 마법 피해. 실제로 멀리 날아갈수록 피해가 커져 최대 <#ffb900ff>250%<>.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 방울을 차서 맞힌 적 챔피언에게 <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> 마법 피해, <#ffb900ff>1.4초<> <#ef5350ff>졸음<>(30% 둔화) 뒤 <#ffb900ff>2.25초<> <#ef5350ff>수면<>. 어떤 피해든 맞으면 깨어나고 그 피해를 고정 피해로 한 번 더(상한 있음).",
        "ult": "[확장] 차원문을 넘어 적 챔피언 쪽으로 이동해 별을 던져 <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> 마법 피해, 투사체 3개. <#ff9028ff>주문도둑<>: 적 챔피언이 궁극기를 쓰면 주문 파편이 떨어지고, 주우면 투사체 3개(개당 <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>)와 이동 속도 +40%."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_zoe": {
        "skill": "【拡張】星を投げ、最初に当たった敵に<#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>の魔法ダメージ。実際に遠くまで飛ぶほど強く、最大<#ffb900ff>250%<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】泡を蹴り、当たった敵チャンピオンに<#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<>の魔法ダメージ、<#ffb900ff>1.4秒<><#ef5350ff>まどろみ<>（30%スロウ）の後<#ffb900ff>2.25秒<><#ef5350ff>睡眠<>。どんなダメージでも目覚め、その一撃を確定ダメージでもう一度（上限あり）。",
        "ult": "【拡張】ポータルを抜けて敵チャンピオンの方へ跳び、星を投げて<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<>の魔法ダメージ、弾3発。<#ff9028ff>スペルシーフ<>：敵チャンピオンがアルティメットを使うと呪文の欠片が落ち、拾うと弾3発（1発<#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>）と移動速度+40%。"
      }
    }
  }
}
